    <briefdescription>
<para>ROOT GUI application lifecycle management. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Defines the <ref refid="classfccvis_1_1gui_1_1GuiApplication" kindref="compound">fccvis::gui::GuiApplication</ref> class, which owns and manages the ROOT <computeroutput>TApplication</computeroutput> instance used by the FCCVisualization graphical interface.</para>
<para>The GUI application is associated with an existing <ref refid="classfccvis_1_1session_1_1Session" kindref="compound">fccvis::session::Session</ref> and provides the main event loop and termination interface for the graphical application.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>Amir H. Ebrahimnezhad <ulink url="mailto:amir.ebh@cern.ch">amir.ebh@cern.ch</ulink></para>
